# The #5289 shape: an explicit alias set never consults the alias reservation.
MODULE: ReservationExcludesAliasChangesAdmitIgnoresReservation
TARGET: ReservationExcludesAliasChanges
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an explicit alias set ignores the reservation (#5289)
PERTURBS: ExplicitAdmit

--- FIND
    /\ IF reserved = "None"
       THEN explicit' = "Admitted"
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF TRUE
       THEN explicit' = "Admitted"
--- END
